-- 0786 · The faith demo community is renamed: "Sunrise Jain Temple (Demo)" becomes "Sunrise Worship Center (Demo)" (owner, 2026-10-14).
--
-- Two parts, in one transaction:
--   1. The pack: demo_faith_jain_v1 goes to version 2 with the new name, short name, slug and newsletter title, so a community
--      created or reset from now on carries them. Its vocabulary is still a Jain Center's (category jain_center: Pathshala, bolis,
--      tapasvis, a "Temple building" fund); only the name of the organization changed. The pack's key does not change: a demo
--      community points at it (rules.demo_pack), and so do the tests.
--   2. The community that already exists is renamed in place. A reset keeps the centers row (app.demo_keep_tables), so without this
--      the existing community would keep the old name for ever; the demo community guard (0678) lets the system rename it. Nothing
--      else of it changes: same id, same people, same QuickBooks connection and mapping, same demo sign-ins. Text that was loaded
--      from the old pack (the newsletter title) updates at the next reset.
-- The pack part below is GENERATED (see its own header); the rename part is written by hand.

